---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About: Stranger Than Heaven Tracker"
  description="Who is behind this unofficial Stranger Than Heaven tracker, how it is built, and how to report a mistake."
  path="/about/"
>
  <h1>About this site</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    An unofficial companion for Stranger Than Heaven: a tracker for completionists, and a sourced reference for
    everyone else.
  </p>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Why it exists</h2>
    <p>
      Trophy lists are easy to find. A list you can tick, filter by act and keep spoiler-free is harder. This site
      does that, and puts the facts about the release next to it with a source on each one.
    </p>

    <h2>Who runs it</h2>
    <p>
      It is part of Tidy Magpie, a small independent publisher based in Australia. It is built and maintained with the
      help of AI tools, under human direction. It is not affiliated with SEGA, RGG Studio, Microsoft, Sony or Valve.
    </p>

    <h2>How it is kept accurate</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every fact carries a source, listed under <a href="/sources/">Sources and updates</a>.</li>
      <li>Pre-release information is labelled as such, and unannounced details are listed as unannounced.</li>
      <li>The achievement data is covered by automated checks, and the code is public.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Found a mistake?</h2>
    <p>
      Please open an issue on the
      <a href="https://github.com/sujingxian/tidymagpie/issues">project's GitHub page</a> and say which page it is on.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
